align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0;width:650px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0;padding-top:40px\"><p style=\"Margin:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;-ms-text-size-adjust:none;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:'source sans pro', 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;line-height:21px;color:#0c1c30;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, 'helvetica neue', arial, verdana, sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><strong>Vielen Dank für deine Anmeldung zum Mum Life Balance Newsletter</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, 'helvetica neue', arial, verdana, sans-serif\">Du hast '%LISTNAME%' am %SUBDATE% mit der E-Mail-Adresse %EMAIL% abonniert.</span></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"es-content\" align=\"center\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;table-layout:fixed !important;width:100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0;background-color:#ffffff\"><table bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" class=\"es-content-body\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;background-color:transparent;width:650px\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px\"><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0;width:650px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0;padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:40px\"><p style=\"Margin:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;-ms-text-size-adjust:none;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:helvetica, 'helvetica neue', arial, verdana, sans-serif;line-height:21px;color:#0c1c30;font-size:14px\">Damit ich dir in Zukunft wertvolle Infos rund um dein erfülltest Leben als Mama senden darf, bitte ich dich deine Email-Adresse einmal zu bestätigen. Vielen Dank.</p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0\"><!--[if mso]><a href=\"%CONFIRMLINK%\" target=\"_blank\" hidden>\n\t<v:roundrect xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:w=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\" esdevVmlButton href=\"%CONFIRMLINK%\" \n                style=\"height:41px; v-text-anchor:middle; width:220px\" arcsize=\"7%\" stroke=\"f\"  fillcolor=\"#dc822e\">\n\t\t<w:anchorlock></w:anchorlock>\n\t\t<center style='color:#ffffff; font-family:\"source sans pro\", \"helvetica neue\", helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:400; line-height:15px;  mso-text-raise:1px'>Email-Adresse best&auml;tigen</center>\n\t</v:roundrect></a>\n<![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!-- --><span class=\"msohide es-button-border\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-color:#004CFF;background:#dc822e;border-width:0px;display:inline-block;border-radius:3px;width:auto;mso-border-alt:10px;mso-hide:all\"><a href=\"%CONFIRMLINK%\" class=\"es-button\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"mso-style-priority:100 !important;text-decoration:none;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;-ms-text-size-adjust:none;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;padding:10px 15px 10px 15px;display:inline-block;background:#dc822e;border-radius:3px;font-family:'source sans pro', 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;line-height:22px;width:auto;text-align:center;border-color:#dc822e\">Email-Adresse bestätigen</a></span><!--<![endif]--></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0;padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:40px\"><p style=\"Margin:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;-ms-text-size-adjust:none;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:helvetica, 'helvetica neue', arial, verdana, sans-serif;line-height:18px;color:#0c1c30;font-size:12px\">Wenn du der Meinung bist, dass dies ein Fehler ist, und du nicht beabsichtigt hast, diese Liste zu abonnieren, kannst du diese Meldung ignorieren.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><table class=\"es-footer ac-footer\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;table-layout:fixed !important;width:100%;background-color:transparent;background-repeat:repeat;background-position:center top\"><tr><td align=\"center\" class=\"es-footer-body\" style=\"padding:0;Margin:0;background-color:transparent;padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px;background:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;color:inherit\"><p style=\"Margin:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;-ms-text-size-adjust:none;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-family:inherit;line-height:150%;color:inherit;font-size:inherit\">Gesendet an: %EMAIL%<br><br><a style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;-ms-text-size-adjust:none;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;text-decoration:underline;color:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-weight:inherit\" href=\"%UNSUBSCRIBELINK%\" target=\"_blank\">Abbestellen</a><br><br><span class=\"perstag_address\" style=\"color:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit\">%SENDER-INFO-SINGLELINE%</span></p></td></tr></table></body></html>\n",
 "text": "**Vielen Dank für deine Anmeldung zum Mum Life Balance Newsletter**\n\nDu hast '%LISTNAME%' am %SUBDATE% mit der E-Mail-Adresse %EMAIL%\nabonniert.\n\nDamit ich dir in Zukunft wertvolle Infos rund um dein erfülltest Leben\nals Mama senden darf, bitte ich dich deine Email-Adresse einmal zu\nbestätigen. Vielen Dank.\n\nEmail-Adresse bestätigen <%CONFIRMLINK%>\n\nWenn du der Meinung bist, dass dies ein Fehler ist, und du nicht\nbeabsichtigt hast, diese Liste zu abonnieren, kannst du diese Meldung\nignorieren.\n\nGesendet an: %EMAIL%\n\nAbbestellen <%UNSUBSCRIBELINK%>\n\n%SENDER-INFO-SINGLELINE%",
